From: Leandro <academy@mindsofthefuture.com.br>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:59:33 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] vndk: Restore com.android.vndk.v30

SM-T735 ships an Android 11 (VNDK 30) vendor. Needs prebuilts/vndk/v30.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Iad3e7c7c75c1b890b95e506daf557c0d7db9a353
---
 apex/Android.bp | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apex/Android.bp b/apex/Android.bp
index baf8d19..8f194df 100644
--- a/apex/Android.bp
+++ b/apex/Android.bp
@@ -63,3 +63,10 @@ apex_vndk {
     vndk_version: "31",
     system_ext_specific: true,
 }
+
+apex_vndk {
+    name: "com.android.vndk.v30",
+    defaults: ["vndk-apex-defaults"],
+    vndk_version: "30",
+    system_ext_specific: true,
+}
